    description: "Operator clarifications during tranche 05 invalidate how discovery is specified. Required edits to .agent/agent_playbooks_protocols_sops_skills/twenty-pass-dogfood-procedure.md: (A) Discovery is SEQUENTIAL only; remove --discovery-mode region-parallel (concurrent workers miss each other's findings, defeating accumulation); drop region.txt/region assignment. (B) Drop 'independent passes' language in Step 1.1 — passes are neither independent nor dependent; each finds issues NOT already in the ledger; ledger updated between passes. (C) A chunk is a context-management unit ONLY (context fills after ~N passes); no parallelism/independence semantics. (D) Worker loads the FULL agent-notes ledger via scripts/agent-notes --show at chunk start; remove the distilled registry.json staging (Step 0.6 becomes 'ensure agent_notes de-primed/clean'). (E) Worker INTEGRATES each finding into the ledger — add new row OR enrich existing row by judgment — replacing Step 1.2 #5's parent-folds-distilled-rows; parent retains only immutable pass_NN.md global numbering/F-numbers. (F) Reconcile de-prime principle: worker makes a provisional new-vs-enrich integration call for live ledger coherence, Phase 3 two-axis dedup remains the AUTHORITATIVE cohort/novelty decision. F ALSO requires correcting the AGENTS.md essentialization ('downstream dedup stages decide novelty, not the worker') and the on_transcript_change.py hook summary — GOVERNANCE files, need human approval, do not self-merge. (G) Update tunables table, Appendix B de-prime table, vendor-table staging refs to match. Origin: tranche 05 (first de-primed tranche) operator corrections 2026-06-05. Do the revision PR AFTER tranche 05 completes so the run is evidence."  # 27b2
